==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Noble Victories|Cryogonal|33}} from the {{TCG|Noble Victories}} expansion.
*'''Frozen Lock''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Unified Minds|Cryogonal|46}} from the {{TCG|Unified Minds}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

